#: 11361eaed65a48d18d2ec48d1dae31eb 66000813a56f409fb86c5084f8e742f4
msgid ""
"**Related API**: [Fields API](../../reference/api/fields), ScalarField guide"
msgstr "**関連 API**: [Fields API](../../reference/api/fields)、ScalarField ガイド"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:10019
#: fd8398fa5217499d8a6d9d4ec8356b8d
msgid ""
"**Related theory**: [Architecture and Data "
