msgstr ""
"**関連理論**: "
"[アーキテクチャとデータフロー](../../explanation/architecture.md)、[検証済みアルゴリズム](../../explanation/validated_algorithms.md)"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:20002
#: dc2cb409415545809338638b4aaac77b
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "準備"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_scalar_intro.ipynb:20004
